    ["<Assistant_Title1>【拉姆德古堡】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>地图简介：</>沉寂已久的古堡伫立于群山深处，残存的高塔与石墙，仍诉说着昔日的辉煌。该古堡属于第四纪末统治拉姆德小镇的领主。\n<Assistant_Title2>【秩序世界】：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①原著旧梦：</>\n{JumpToUI:足迹追寻|1301083}  {JumpToUI:原著瞬间|1301082}\n<Assistant_Title3>②世界玩法：</>\n{JumpToUI:隐秘空间|1301088}  {JumpToUI:时虫宝藏|1301089}  {JumpToUI:灵体之线|1301086}  {JumpToUI:吟游诗人|1301084}  {JumpToUI:风暴追逐|1301957}  {JumpToUI:诡变宝箱|1301087}  {JumpToUI:异象之物|1301081}  {JumpToUI:非凡扮演|1301960}\n<Assistant_Title2>【时代任务】：</>\n{JumpToUI:时代逸闻|1302433}  {JumpToUI:扮演故事|1302434}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[Lamud Castle]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Map Introduction: </>A long-silent ancient castle standing deep in the mountains. The remaining towers and stone walls still tell of its former glory. This castle belonged to the lord who ruled Lamud Town at the end of the Fourth Epoch.\n<Assistant_Title2>[Order World]:</>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Moments from the Original Work:</>\n{JumpToUI:Footprint Tracking|1301083} {JumpToUI:Moments from the Original Work|1301082}\n<Assistant_Title3>② World Gameplay:</>\n{JumpToUI:Hidden Space|1301088} {JumpToUI:Worm of Time Treasure|1301089} {JumpToUI:Spirit Body Threads|1301086} {JumpToUI:Bard|1301084} {JumpToUI:Storm Chasing|1301957} {JumpToUI:Mysterious Treasure Chest|1301087} {JumpToUI:Object of Phenomenon|1301081} {JumpToUI:Extraordinary Roleplay|1301960}\n<Assistant_Title2>[Era Quests]:</>\n{JumpToUI:Era Anecdotes|1302433} {JumpToUI:Roleplay Story|1302434}",
