    ["“在壁炉的火焰熄灭之前……”"] = "\"Before the fireplace's flames go out...\"",
    ["　　因突发事件和任务需要，现特批准许廷根市值夜者小队文职人员克莱恩·莫雷蒂先生成为非凡者：序列9“占卜家”。\n　　请协助克莱恩·莫雷蒂完成序列晋升。"] = "Due to unexpected events and mission requirements, Mr. Klein Moretti, a civilian staff member of the Tingen Nighthawks, is hereby specially approved to become an Extraordinary: Sequence 9 \"Seer\".\nPlease assist Klein Moretti in completing his sequence advancement.",
    ["　　我的选择很简单，“通识者”！有完整序列的“通识者”！\n　　虽然掌握更多的神秘学知识有助于我找到回家的办法，但问题是，自身不够强大的情况下，穿越这种事情必然借助外力，而外力是好是坏，是善意还是恶意，无法控制，非常危险，既然如此，还不如让自身变得强大，靠自己的力量回去，所以，完整的序列是我考虑的首要因素！"] = "My choice was simple: \"Savant\"! A \"Savant\" with a complete sequence! \n Although mastering more occult knowledge helps me find a way home, the problem is that without being strong enough, crossing over requires external help, and whether that help is good or bad, well-intentioned or malicious, is uncontrollable and very dangerous. Since that's the case, it's better to become strong myself and rely on my own power to go back. Therefore, a complete sequence is the primary factor I consider!",
